# Veteran Survivor: "Survival - At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, exile up to one target card
# from a graveyard." and "As long as there are three or more cards exiled with this creature, it gets +3/+3 and has hexproof."
# Survivor attacks on turns 3, 5 and 7 and exiles one Faithless Looting from Bot1's graveyard each time. After the first and the
# second exile it is still a 2/1 with no hexproof (the condition false, with two); after the third it is a 5/4 with hexproof
# (true, at three), and Bot2 can no longer target it with Lightning Bolt (the refusal). The first exiled card is taken from
# Bot2's graveyard, to show the target may be in any graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Veteran Survivor
Faithless Looting
Faithless Looting
Faithless Looting
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x20

